WEBVTT

00:01:29.496 --> 00:01:33.829
(Voice-over) (In Kinyarwanda)
PC: I first met Therese in 2018.

00:01:35.329 --> 00:01:40.621
She was eager to learn
modern agricultural methods.

00:01:41.788 --> 00:01:45.121
(Women speaking)

00:01:48.579 --> 00:01:52.454
TN: My harvest was not enough
to feed my family.

00:01:53.038 --> 00:01:55.954
I struggled to feed my children.

00:01:56.871 --> 00:02:02.079
I decided to expand my land